SDL_mixer: match the selected Vorbis callback declaration's const input.

The normal Vorbis API takes a const initial-data buffer. Preserve the Tremor
signature and keep the existing dynamic-loader conversion consistent with the
function-pointer declaration. No cast is added to the static assignment.
Upstream SDL_mixer notices remain unchanged (LGPL-2.0-or-later).

